        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I contacted this company to install an EV charger at home. I had the equipment (cable + breaker) and I was told it would cost about $400 for the labor. The cable had cost me $300 and the breaker $55. They came to view the job and I later received a quote for $1,380 with the material and tax in, way above the $400 + the cost of the material. I followed up multiple times (text and calls) without any reply. I do not recommend as the company is unreliable and I ended up wasting my time.",
